1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:02,979
You know, stay here for a weekend,
see what it's like.

2
00:00:03,142 --> 00:00:05,642
(Bernadette:)- Your mom would be okay with that?
- Sure, she would.

3
00:00:05,811 --> 00:00:08,441
(Howard:)Ma, do you mind if Bernadette
stays here this weekend?

4
00:00:08,606 --> 00:00:11,316
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Hey, if she's
willing to give the milk away for free...

5
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:13,904
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)...who am I to say no?

6
00:00:15,947 --> 00:00:17,237
(Howard:)See? She's good with it.

7
00:00:18,908 --> 00:00:22,618
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Frankly, after all
your sleepovers with the little brown boy...

8
00:00:22,787 --> 00:00:25,497
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)...a girl is a big relief.

9
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:38,010
All these years, I've been so wrong.

10
00:00:38,177 --> 00:00:42,927
(Sheldon:)The tinier the train,
the more concentrated the fun.

11
00:00:46,143 --> 00:00:47,853
(Penny:)You're a brain scientist.

12
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:51,310
Can you explain why a brilliant man
Iikes playing with toy trains?

13
00:00:51,482 --> 00:00:53,822
(Amy:)Not without cutting his head open, no.

14
00:00:55,653 --> 00:00:57,823
(Amy:)How about making my eyes
Iike Cleopatra?

